# Both root-context images (Dockerfile and admin/Dockerfile) COPY an explicit
# list of paths, so nothing below is ever in an image — it is only context sent
# to the daemon on every build. `admin` is deliberately absent: admin/Dockerfile
# builds from this same root context and needs it.
#
# The backend builds from ./backend against its own .dockerignore, so its source
# has no reason to be here either.
